   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The verb έχω",
     "texto": [
      "**Έχω** means «I have». It is conjugated **έχω, έχεις, έχει** (I, you, he/she).",
      "Family words usually come with an article: **ο πατέρας** (the father), **η μητέρα** (the mother), **το παιδί** (the child). With people, **μου** means «my» and goes after the noun: **ο αδελφός μου**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
